# AGS launcher artwork (header/hero/marquee) is consumed by tools/generate_artwork.py
# and just package / tools/Install.ps1 — never by Godot. This file tells the
# Godot editor/importer to skip this subtree entirely, so no .import sidecars
# are generated and nothing here is packed into the game .pck.
# Godot runtime art lives in res://assets/ instead.
